text:
{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "That was the trouble with a good load.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The Road counted that as a debt too, and priced it worse.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The book doesn't.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "awful lightness that is not relief",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The board says *sealed cargo: subject to inspection.* This is the inspection.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "it came out the same as it always came out: no.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "spent here, standing on cold stone, arguing about wax.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "and Wren had stopped explaining after that.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Something in the meat of him that had been counting quietly",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 19/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "weighed nothing it hadn't weighed yesterday",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That was the only sign anyone had been proud of the place",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "where a pen had worn her",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It's the one I've got.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the way a woman says a rule she has decided not to have feelings about",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "went five smaller",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "which he had learned to do the way a man learns a road",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "it was not a hard sum",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "with it sitting behind his teeth",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It was eight the wrong way",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It might have been a C.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the book was the book",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "two numbers in him now, going in different directions",
      "kind": "quip"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "Nobody had said anything about the bottom.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "in a hand he'd taught himself the winter his ink froze",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "a coat he'd grow into",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "told himself both times that he was checking the weather",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Three the wrong way.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the boy had done nothing but write",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That was the whole of the difference",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "you're carrying that wrong and I'm not going to say so",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "before anyone could call it leaning",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Correct. Correct to the day",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He walked out from under nothing",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the book took four more than it should have",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "wrote the entry anyway with blood in the crease of the paper",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "he got up and walked, because that was the arrangement",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "and the book was flawless",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "a man's spent life added correctly at every single window",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "where he'd written *alone*, the owed number had climbed",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "taken out of him in a margin",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "MP ?/?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "the knee looked like a thing that had been argued with",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's not a carry, that's a wager.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Everyone's got a cousin who did it the once.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Did the once and what?",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "She shrugged with the shoulder that still worked.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's what I'm telling you.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "because the second crate sat high and wanted to steer him",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He went on, listing, at about the pace of a funeral.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "whose chest already rattled when he breathed out",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "some week he'd never be introduced to, folded away",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Four the wrong way.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "show him the line, right way up, like a favour",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the thin man said, almost kindly. Not many get that.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "laughed once, which hurt his chest, and then stopped.",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 13/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "which told Wren more about the road than the pause did",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "There's a mouse in there I've named.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Which is the same thing said slower.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "I'm not a gate, I'm a man with a stamp.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "stopped counting after that",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He had half expected it not to.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "somebody had decided the column was not worth printing",
      "kind": "quip"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "the way you learn to walk around a hole in a floor",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The clerk stamped it anyway, thirty, without any change in his face",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "I am",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's not a joke, the chair was under the window",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Then it's just a hole",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He said it the way a man says the tide comes in",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "a man with a pen was asleep somewhere behind a shuttered window",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 17/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "with a frame too big for him and a load too small",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "wasn't taking weight without going somewhere behind his eyes",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "didn't offer a hand, which he was grateful for",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Then you've got a witness",
      "kind": "banter"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The five were exact. The six had grown.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "a version that was arithmetic and a version that was his father",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "As four",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Bloody hell",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "I read it three times to be sure of it",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Something went out of the collector's face",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "had never once been asked for it",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Eleven,\" said Wren. \"Mine go back to Ferrous.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "I know what it does",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "with a sheet the colour of a dead tooth",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "no version of this where he could not be made to",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the way a man reaches for his own pocket, and stopped there",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The hand came back",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "putting it down would have meant getting it up again",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}
